# Release 14.2 — Executive Workspace Polish

This release improves visual hierarchy without changing the demo-company data.

## Changes
- Compact overnight Executive Brief
- Dashboard and Atlas displayed side by side on desktop
- Sticky, focused Atlas conversation dock
- Shorter visible conversation history
- Compact suggested prompts and input
- Dashboard metrics visible higher on the page
- Supporting evidence remains expandable
- Responsive stacked layout on smaller screens
